                Front-End Developer
              </h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-[1.75] pt-2 pb-2">
                Desarrollo de proyectos web y app:
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm font-light">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-[#007d8e] text-xs mt-1.5">•</span>
                  <span>Frameworks: Angular, React, Vue | Lenguajes: HTML5, SCSS, JavaScript, TypeScript.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-[#007d8e] text-xs mt-1.5">•</span>
                  <span>Softwares: Figma, VisualStudio, Filezilla, Docker, Photoshop, PhpMyAdmin.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-[#007d8e] text-xs mt-1.5">•</span>
                  <span>Creación de sitios web y ecommerce con Wordpress.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-[#007d8e] text-xs mt-1.5">•</span>
                  <span>Maquetación newsletters HTML5 | QA test (Litmus).</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- ITEM 3 -->
